<view class="container"><view class="section-title">训练历史</view><view class="muted mt16">记录你的每一次进步</view><view class="list mt24"><view class="card item" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id"><view><text class="title">{{item.course}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="score">{{item.score}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="empty card">还没有训练记录，完成一次AI训练后会出现在这里。</view></view>